	ease meet at the Information signage located between the 610 Parking Loop 
	and the Nature Center Building. \n\n\n\nVenture out with an Arboretum Guid
	e for a hike through the Houston Arboretum. Explore our ecosystems to lear
	n about the local wildlife\, plants\, and natural history of our beautiful
	 nature center. Hikes will vary but expect to spend 40-45 minutes on the t
	rail.  \n\n\n\nPlease come prepared for the outdoors. Closed toe shoes\, a
	 water bottle\, weather-appropriate hiking attire\, and bug spray are reco
	mmended. \n\n\n\nupcoming hikes\n\n\n\n\n\nEnglish \n\n\n\nSeptember 12Oct
	ober 3November 7December 5 \n\n\n\n\n\nEspañol \n\n\n\nSeptiembre 19Octubr
